---
const githubUrl = "https://github.com/vignesh-chaturvedi/divergence";
---

<section class="section benchmark" id="benchmark" aria-labelledby="benchmark-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-intro section-intro--row">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The benchmark</p>
        <h2 id="benchmark-heading">Lead with the false-positive traps.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        The candidate corpus contains 110 synthetic artifacts: 50 risk-positive and 60
        benign or control samples. Every result carries its denominator and provenance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="benchmark__layout">
      <div class="benchmark-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Benchmark comparison; scroll horizontally on small screens">
        <table class="benchmark-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Scanner</th>
              <th scope="col">Trap false positives</th>
              <th scope="col">Precision</th>
              <th scope="col">Recall</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="benchmark-table__featured">
              <th scope="row">
                <span class="benchmark-table__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Divergence static
              </th>
              <td><strong>0/35</strong></td>
              <td>100%</td>
              <td>27/50</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="benchmark-table__featured">
              <th scope="row">
                <span class="benchmark-table__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Divergence + dynamic
              </th>
              <td><strong>0/35</strong></td>
              <td>100%</td>
              <td><strong>49/50</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Semgrep 1.173.0</th>
              <td>5/35</td>
              <td>81.1%</td>
              <td>30/50</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Keyword baseline</th>
              <td>20/35</td>
              <td>52.9%</td>
              <td>27/50</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <aside class="benchmark-note" aria-label="Benchmark limitations">
        <p class="eyebrow">Read this with the table</p>
        <h3>Candidate evidence, not a universal guarantee.</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>The scanner and corpus share an author.</li>
          <li>Independent label and rationale review remains open.</li>
          <li>Dynamic evidence is path-dependent and Linux-only.</li>
          <li>83/110 runtime entrypoints were confirmed.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${githubUrl}/tree/main/benchmarks/v1.1`}>
          Inspect the JSON evidence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
